 "purpose": "RTX Hair item 11 at S8 in the rv3 view and turns: rt_hair_header_cam_gpu and rt_hair_watchdog_draw off / cam / draw / both / off in one run. With the GPU header camera: sampled origin 0, frame watchdog trips 0, no watchdog card fallback, evidence strand share >= 0.891; the re-read proof counter reports record-time vs submit camera mismatches in every window (OFF: watchdog trips and nonzero origins)."
